  "caveat": "The held-out data are generated by the project's own simulator (safeguard_pq.simulation) whose traffic parameters were designed around these rules; the numbers demonstrate that the held-out protocol runs end-to-end and are NOT evidence of detection performance on real traffic. Real held-out numbers require the CICIoMT2024 CSV folders (user-downloaded, not redistributed). Bootstrap intervals resample windows independently although consecutive windows of one capture are correlated, so the intervals are narrower than a capture-level resampling would give. Small classes (e.g. 17 ARP-spoofing or MQTT-malformed windows in the CICIoMT2024 test split) have wide Wilson intervals."
